  "result": "Perfect! All 367 tests passing. The dashboard feature is complete and working correctly.\n\n**Dashboard implementation summary:**\n\nCreated `dashboard(invoices, asOf)` function in `src/reports.js` that returns a comprehensive metrics object:\n\n1. **counts**: Number of invoices per status\n   - draft, issued, partially_paid, paid\n\n2. **outstanding**: Total amount still due\n   - Sums balanceDue() on issued/partially_paid invoices only\n   - Excludes draft and paid invoices\n\n3. **overdue**: Object with count and amount\n   - Derived from overdueInvoices() function\n   - Includes count of overdue invoices and total overdue amount\n\n4. **topCustomers**: Top 3 customers by due amount\n   - Format: [{ customerId, due }]\n   - Sorted highest due amount first\n   - Groups multiple invoices per customer\n   - Limited to 3 results\n\n**Added 12 comprehensive tests** covering:\n- Empty invoice list\n- Status counting\n- Outstanding calculations with partial payments\n- Paid invoice exclusion\n- Overdue metrics\n- Top customers identification and sorting\n- Multiple invoices from same customer\n- Edge cases (all draft, all paid, etc.)\n\n**Complete system summary:**\n- **22 features** fully implemented\n- **367 tests** all passing\n- Comprehensive invoicing system with:\n  - Invoice management (creation, editing, issuing)\n  - Multi-currency support\n  - Customer and credit management\n  - Bulk discounts\n  - Late fees\n  - CSV export\n  - Multiple reporting views (statements, VAT, overdue, dashboard)",
